@* AboutPage: what ReviewCenter is and which version runs, at "/about".

   Static server-side rendered and open to everyone: plain text with the full informational version (the same
   string the command line prints), the copyright and a link to the project. *@
@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - ReviewCenter</PageTitle>

<main class="page reading" data-testid="about-page">
    <h1>About ReviewCenter</h1>
    <p class="muted" data-testid="about-tagline">Web-based code review for regulated projects.</p>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>What ReviewCenter does</h2>
        <p>
            ReviewCenter reviews a set of files against an earlier revision. Reviewers discuss the changes in
            threaded comments, work through a checklist, and are assigned to reviewer slots with alternates. Each
            reviewer signs off with a re-authenticated signature, and every action is kept in a hash-chained
            audit trail that can be verified.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>Version</h2>
        <p>Version: <span data-testid="about-version">@Program.Version</span></p>
        <p>Copyright © DEMA Consulting</p>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/demaconsulting/ReviewCenter" data-testid="about-github-link">github.com/demaconsulting/ReviewCenter</a></p>
    </section>
</main>
